<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Oil again omits payout.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Oil again omits payout.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Oil and Gas Royalty Trust said Monday there will be no distribution for July 1997.</p>
<p>The trust last paid a dividend in October 1995.</p>
<p>The trust's Class A costs for the month of July 1997 exceeded gross proceeds by $1,557,444, increasing the cumulative Class A cost carry-forward to $8,856,580, it said.</p>
<p>In addition, net current month trust administrative expenses of $15,875 will be paid from the Trust administrative expense reserve resulting in about $1.8 million remaining in the expense reserve.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
